# The root .gitignore ignores every `dist/` directory, but `@awacloud/odf`
# ships its dual build surfaces (dist/build + dist/standalone) as GENERATED +
# COMMITTED artifacts so consumers get pre-built bundles without a build step.
# Re-include them here.
!dist/
!dist/**

# The root .gitignore ignores every `coverage` directory (bun's run output).
# The committed coverage scorecard (tools/office-scorecard) lives in it:
# re-include that one file only.
!coverage/
coverage/*
!coverage/scorecard.json
# The axis-C evidence records (every file an external validator judged,
# with its messages) live beside it.
!coverage/evidence/
